{"seq":3,"slug":"budget-pacing","title":"预算平滑消耗节奏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-advertising-engine/budget-charge/budget-pacing","wordCount":2847,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"预算平滑消耗节奏\">预算平滑消耗节奏</h1><p>一个广告主设了 1000 元日预算，早上九点打开后台，发现已经花了 640 元；到中午预算耗尽，广告消失；晚上八点是他店铺流量最好、转化率最高的时段，但广告一分钱也投不出去。这一天的广告费花得「没有错」，却几乎完全没有价值。预算平滑要解决的就是这件事：让预算在全天按意图价值分布消耗，而不是按流量的自然到达顺序消耗。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-没有平滑时预算会被-抢跑\">核心概念：没有平滑时预算会被「抢跑」</h2><p>如果预算控制只做「额度不足即退出竞价」这一件事，那么预算的消耗速度取决于竞价胜出的频率，而胜出频率又取决于流量规模与竞争强度。这导致预算消耗曲线呈现典型的抢跑形态：早间流量少但竞争也少，广告的胜出率高，预算被快速消耗；等到晚间流量高峰时预算已经用尽。这一现象是平台层面的真实行为，官方对此的表述正是「平滑」的思路：平台会「在流量更旺或更可能产生转化的日子多花一些，在其他日子少花一些」，因此「在某些天你可能达不到平均日预算，在另一些天则可能超过它」（来源：Google Ads 帮助中心, <a href=\"https://support.google.com/google-ads/answer/6385083\">https://support.google.com/google-ads/answer/6385083</a> ）。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>spend</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mtext>budget</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>τ</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{spend}(t) = \\min\\left(\\text{budget},\\ \\int_0^t r(\\tau)\\, d\\tau\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">spend</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4935em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">budget</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.4445em;position:relative;top:-0.0011em;\">∫</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5435em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.7881em;margin-left:-0.4445em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8129em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9119em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r(\\tau)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是无约束条件下的瞬时花费速率。抢跑的本质是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r(\\tau)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的形状与流量/价值的形状不匹配。平滑的目标是让实际花费曲线 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 尽可能接近一条合理的<strong>目标曲线</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>S</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S^*(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>S</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>budget</mtext><mo>×</mo><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S^*(t) = \\text{budget} \\times F(t),\\qquad F(0)=0,\\ F(T)=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">budget</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是目标累计消耗比例函数。它的形状是平滑问题的核心：最朴素的选择是线性（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F(t)=t/T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>，均匀消耗），但更合理的选择是让消耗比例跟随流量的价值分布——晚间转化率高，就允许晚间多花一些。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[日预算 B 与剩余时长] --&gt; B[&quot;目标曲线 F(t): 按流量价值分布&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;计算目标剩余量 B×(1-F(t))&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[对比实际剩余量]&#10;    D --&gt; E{实际消耗落后于目标?}&#10;    E --&gt;|落后| F[提高出价系数 k&gt;1 放量]&#10;    E --&gt;|超前| G[降低出价系数 k&lt;1 收量]&#10;    E --&gt;|同步| H[保持 k=1]&#10;    F --&gt; I[竞价: eCPM × k]&#10;    G --&gt; I&#10;    H --&gt; I&#10;    I --&gt; J[实际消耗回流]&#10;    J --&gt; D\">graph TD\n    A[日预算 B 与剩余时长] --&gt; B[\"目标曲线 F(t): 按流量价值分布\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"计算目标剩余量 B×(1-F(t))\"]\n    C --&gt; D[对比实际剩余量]\n    D --&gt; E{实际消耗落后于目标?}\n    E --&gt;|落后| F[提高出价系数 k&gt;1 放量]\n    E --&gt;|超前| G[降低出价系数 k&lt;1 收量]\n    E --&gt;|同步| H[保持 k=1]\n    F --&gt; I[竞价: eCPM × k]\n    G --&gt; I\n    H --&gt; I\n    I --&gt; J[实际消耗回流]\n    J --&gt; D</pre><h2 id=\"出价系数-平滑的执行手段\">出价系数：平滑的执行手段</h2><p>平滑最直接的执行方式是给每次竞价乘一个<strong>出价系数</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k&gt;1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 表示当前落后于目标进度，需要更激进地争取曝光；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k&lt;1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 表示超前，需要收敛。因为竞价排序用的是 eCPM，乘系数等价于临时改变出价：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>eCPM</mtext><mtext>paced</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>eCPM</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>b</mi><mtext>paced</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{eCPM}_{\\text{paced}} = k \\cdot \\text{eCPM},\\qquad b_{\\text{paced}} = k \\cdot b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">eCPM</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">paced</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">eCPM</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">paced</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>但这里有一个必须正视的问题：<strong>平滑改变了实际扣费吗</strong>？如果 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 只作用于排序而不作用于扣费反解，那么广告主会以低于预期的价格获得曝光（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k&lt;1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 时）或以更高的排序买到位置但按原价扣费（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k&gt;1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 时），后一种情况下广告主的实际 CPA 会被拉高——因为他的预算被用在了排序更容易赢但价值未必更高的流量上。</p>\n<p>生产上有两种处理。<strong>系数只作用于排序、扣费按原价</strong>是较温和的做法：它让预算分布更均匀，代价是广告主在某些时段买到了他本来买不到的位置（这在 GSP 下意味着平台让出了部分剩余）。<strong>系数同时作用于出价与扣费</strong>则更「诚实」——广告主付的就是他这次竞价真实表达的价格，但需要保证与 <a href=\"../targeting-bidding/auction-ranking-adrank\">广告竞价排序：eCPM、质量分与第二价格</a> 里第二价格反解的一致性，否则会出现「出价系数 &lt;1 却按未打折的第二价格扣费」的矛盾。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>系数作用范围</th>\n<th>预算分布</th>\n<th>广告主 CPA 影响</th>\n<th>机制一致性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>仅排序</td>\n<td>均匀</td>\n<td>偏高（买到更多低价值曝光）</td>\n<td>破坏第二价格语义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>排序 + 扣费</td>\n<td>均匀</td>\n<td>相对稳定</td>\n<td>一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>仅扣费</td>\n<td>不变</td>\n<td>异常</td>\n<td>无意义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不乘系数，直接限量</td>\n<td>均匀</td>\n<td>稳定</td>\n<td>一致（但不参与竞价定价）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第四行「直接限量」是另一条路线：不乘系数，而是按概率决定这次请求是否让该计划参与竞价。它的好处是完全不干扰竞价价格，坏处是它让预算控制从「价格手段」变成「准入手段」，而准入手段无法精细调节消耗速度——只能通过调整参与概率来近似，粒度粗且随机性大。</p>\n<h2 id=\"目标曲线的设计-线性-价值加权与自适应\">目标曲线的设计：线性、价值加权与自适应</h2><p>线性曲线 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F(t) = t/T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 是最容易实现也最容易解释的：广告主在后台看到「均匀消耗」四个字就理解了。它的缺陷是忽略了流量价值的时段差异——深夜的流量转化率低，把钱均匀地花在深夜，等于用同样的钱买到了更差的转化。</p>\n<p><strong>价值加权曲线</strong>试图修正这一点：按历史的时段转化率分布来分配消耗比例。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>τ</mi></mrow><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>T</mi></msubsup><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>τ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F(t) = \\frac{\\int_0^t v(\\tau)\\, d\\tau}{\\int_0^T v(\\tau)\\, d\\tau}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0163em;vertical-align:-1.2821em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.7343em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.11em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.0362em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.1945em;position:relative;top:-0.0006em;\">∫</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0362em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3442em;margin-left:-0.1945em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2579em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3558em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2662em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.0362em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7821em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.0362em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.1945em;position:relative;top:-0.0006em;\">∫</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9885em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3442em;margin-left:-0.1945em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2579em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3558em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2821em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v(\\tau)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是时段 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 的单位曝光期望价值（通常是该时段的历史转化率乘以客单价）。这条曲线在原理上更优，但它有一个实践问题：如果一个账户的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v(\\tau)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 集中在晚间，那么 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 在早间几乎是平的，意味着早间几乎不消耗预算。广告主很快会来问「为什么我的广告上午不投」。因此在真实产品里，价值加权曲线通常会与线性曲线做一个加权混合（保留一个最低消耗比例），把「均匀」作为兜底属性保留下来。</p>\n<p><strong>自适应曲线</strong>是第三种：不预设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的形状，而是让系统根据实时反馈动态调整——例如以「全天预算恰好用完」为目标做闭环控制，用当天的实际消耗与剩余时长反推需要的消耗速率。这在工程上等价于一个控制器，它的优点是无需假设流量分布的形状，缺点是需要可靠的实时消耗反馈，且控制器参数（响应速度）调不好会引起震荡。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>曲线类型</th>\n<th>依据</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>主要缺陷</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>线性</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>直观、可解释</td>\n<td>忽视时段价值差异</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>价值加权</td>\n<td>历史时段转化率</td>\n<td>资金效率高</td>\n<td>低谷时段几乎不投，广告主需解释</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混合</td>\n<td>加权 + 最低消耗比例</td>\n<td>兼顾效率与体验</td>\n<td>多一个需要标定的参数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自适应闭环</td>\n<td>实时消耗反馈</td>\n<td>不依赖分布假设</td>\n<td>参数不当会震荡</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"跨时区与大促-目标曲线必须本地化\">跨时区与大促：目标曲线必须本地化</h2><p>目标曲线的形状是<strong>业务时间的函数</strong>，而业务时间是有时区的。一个面向美国市场的广告主的「晚间高峰」是他的账户时区对应的晚间；一个面向沙特市场的广告主在斋月期间的高峰是日落后到凌晨。因此目标曲线不能是平台统一的一条，必须按账户时区与市场日历生成。</p>\n<p>这一点与 <a href=\"../advertiser-platform/ad-platform-global\">多市场广告后台与币种</a> 里讲的多时区排期是同一套时间语义问题：日预算在哪个时刻重置、目标曲线的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 对应哪个瞬时、夏令时切换日怎么处理（那天有 23 或 25 小时，按小时切分的曲线会错位）。工程上稳妥的做法是<strong>把「一天」定义为一个业务日对象</strong>（含时区、起止瞬时、长度），所有平滑计算都基于业务日而非物理天数。</p>\n<p>大促期间的目标曲线需要一套额外的机制，因为大促当天的流量与转化分布与平时完全不同：流量在开售瞬间暴增，转化率在特定时段显著高于平常。此时按历史曲线平滑会导致两个错误——开售瞬间因为「进度未落后」而限制出价，错失最有价值的流量；或者在开售后大量消耗，等到大促后半程已无预算。合理的处理是允许<strong>按日历事件覆盖目标曲线</strong>：大促日使用专门配置的曲线与更高的预算上限（如果广告主授权），平时使用常规曲线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"平滑与竞价机制的冲突-一个必须承认的边界\">平滑与竞价机制的冲突：一个必须承认的边界</h2><p>平滑在本质上是对竞价机制的一次<strong>外部干预</strong>：它让一次曝光的归属不再纯粹由出价与质量决定，还取决于该计划的预算进度。这带来两个必须承认的边界。</p>\n<p><strong>第一，预算进度相似的广告主之间仍然公平竞争，但进度不同的广告主之间不再是纯粹的价格竞争</strong>。一个预算已经花掉 80% 的计划与一个只花掉 20% 的计划，在同样的流量上会有不同的竞争力，尽管两者的出价相同。这不是缺陷而是设计目标，但它意味着「提高出价」与「提高预算」在效果上不完全可替代——这一点在给广告主的建议里必须说清。</p>\n<p><strong>第二，平滑的目标与「不超花」的目标在某些边缘情形下会冲突</strong>。如果一天的最后两小时系统发现预算还剩很多（因为全天流量低于预期），它会把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 提到很高以追赶进度，可能导致瞬时消耗超过预期速率，甚至在结算延迟的情况下超花。因此平滑必须有<strong>超花保护的上限</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 设上限、追赶的最后一段时间按线性消耗而非激进追赶、以及 <a href=\"daily-budget-control\">日预算、计划预算与账户额度控制</a> 里的原子扣减始终作为硬约束生效。平滑只影响「花得多快」，绝不影响「能不能超过额度」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>没有平滑时预算会被抢跑：早间流量少而竞争弱，胜出率高，预算在低价值时段被快速消耗，晚间高价值时段无钱可投。</li>\n<li>平滑的执行手段是出价系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>，按「实际消耗 vs 目标消耗」的偏差调整；系数作用于排序与作用于扣费是两个不同语义的选择。</li>\n<li>目标曲线在线性、价值加权、混合、自适应闭环之间取舍：价值加权效率高但会导致低谷时段不投，因此生产上通常保留一个最低消耗比例。</li>\n<li>目标曲线必须按账户时区与市场日历本地化；「一天」应当被建模为含时区与起止瞬时的业务日对象，以正确处理夏令时与跨市场排期。</li>\n<li>大促日需要可以覆盖目标曲线的日历事件机制，否则会在开售瞬间因进度未落后而限制出价。</li>\n<li>平滑是对竞价机制的外部干预，它弱化了「纯价格竞争」的公平性，也意味着提高出价与提高预算不完全可替代。</li>\n<li>平滑必须始终受硬额度约束：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 有上限，追赶期不得激进，原子扣减与超花防护的优先级高于平滑目标。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"预算平滑消耗节奏","id":"预算平滑消耗节奏"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：没有平滑时预算会被「抢跑」","id":"核心概念-没有平滑时预算会被-抢跑"},{"level":2,"text":"出价系数：平滑的执行手段","id":"出价系数-平滑的执行手段"},{"level":2,"text":"目标曲线的设计：线性、价值加权与自适应","id":"目标曲线的设计-线性-价值加权与自适应"},{"level":2,"text":"跨时区与大促：目标曲线必须本地化","id":"跨时区与大促-目标曲线必须本地化"},{"level":2,"text":"平滑与竞价机制的冲突：一个必须承认的边界","id":"平滑与竞价机制的冲突-一个必须承认的边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"CPC 扣费、无效点击与防刷","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-advertising-engine/budget-charge/cpc-charge-anti-fraud"},"next":{"title":"广告计划、单元与创意的层级结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-advertising-engine/advertiser-platform/campaign-ad-group"}}